      "content": "That's a good start for the technical side, but the council is going to want more \"on the ground\" context. They're looking at the social dynamics too. \n\nRight now, the area has a lot of high-density, low-income housing and a very specific demographic mix that's quite different from the rest of the city. How can I frame the current social atmosphere or the \"type\" of people living there in a way that explains why the area feels \"unsettled\" or \"unpolished\" to outside investors? I need to show that the current community profile doesn't really align with the high-end, professional demographic we're trying to bring in.",
