      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The current public realm exhibits a high degree of informal use that, while vibrant, presents visual inconsistency for outside stakeholders. Street-level activity is characterized by dense, unstructured pedestrian flows and localized, untraditional commerce. This kinetic, \"unrefined\" environment contrasts sharply with the polished, curated experience associated with attracting premier commercial tenants. To align Northwood with the city's forward-looking reputation, a cohesive and elevated aesthetic framework must be established across all public spaces.",
